# opencode CLI local state — plugin cache, the manifests opencode generates for
# it, and the .gitignore opencode writes alongside them.
#
# Deliberately NOT a blanket `.opencode/` ignore. `.opencode/agents/**` and
# `.opencode/skills/**` are this repo's hand-authored agent and skill
# definitions — they encode DepTend-specific conventions that exist nowhere
# else and are committed on purpose. opencode discovers them straight from the
# working tree, so an untracked copy means a fresh clone, CI, or another
# machine silently runs with none of them (and AGENTS.md §0.6's "load
# .opencode/skills/actually-code" becomes unsatisfiable). Keep these patterns
# narrow and per-file; re-verify with
# `git check-ignore -v .opencode/agents/*.md .opencode/skills/*/SKILL.md`.
.opencode/node_modules/
.opencode/package.json
.opencode/package-lock.json
.opencode/bun.lock
.opencode/.gitignore

# Agent locks
.agent-locks/

# Agent-local docs — never commit (Mico, 2026-10-31)
AGENTS.md
GROWTH_PLAN.md
TRAFFIC_GROWTH_PLAN.md

# npm pack/publish artifacts
*.tgz
